{"id":"m2://rec/open_logic/content/first-order-logic/sequent-calculus/proving-things-quant.tex#prob-1#1","source":"open_logic","snapshot":"blake3:a5eb116529d3e799289dd9f7e7530d0d446b3615f5608fe08c668241eee3c765","locator":"https://github.com/OpenLogicProject/OpenLogic/blob/1e960beff9ed7835bf3e3f1335e21af3439cd107/content/first-order-logic/sequent-calculus/proving-things-quant.tex#L85","native_id":"content/first-order-logic/sequent-calculus/proving-things-quant.tex#prob-1","kind":"exercise","text":"Give !!{derivation}s of the following sequents:\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item $\\Sequent (\\lforall[x][!A(x)] \\land \\lforall[y][!B(y)]) \\lif\n\\lforall[z][(!A(z) \\land !B(z))]$.\n\\item $\\Sequent (\\lexists[x][!A(x)] \\lor \\lexists[y][!B(y)]) \\lif\n\\lexists[z][(!A(z) \\lor !B(z))]$.\n\\item $\\lforall[x][(!A(x) \\lif !B)] \\Sequent \\lexists[y][!A(y)] \\lif !B$.\n\\item $\\lforall[x][\\lnot !A(x)] \\Sequent \\lnot\\lexists[x][!A(x)]$.\n\\item $\\Sequent \\lnot\\lexists[x][!A(x)] \\lif \\lforall[x][\\lnot !A(x)]$.\n\\item $\\Sequent \\lnot\\lexists[x][\\lforall[y][((!A(x,y) \\lif \\lnot\n!A(y,y)) \\land (\\lnot !A(y,y) \\lif !A(x,y)))]]$.\n\\end{enumerate}","class":"open","by":"textbook/1","resource":"PKGMM3P5QY","at":{"section":"17.10","kind":"prob"}}
